# LibraTrack – Smart Library Management System

A web-based Smart Library Management System developed using Java Spring Boot. LibraTrack simplifies library operations by managing books, members, book circulation, overdue fines, transactions, and reports through a modern dashboard.

## 1. Project Overview

LibraTrack is designed to digitize traditional library operations. It provides an easy-to-use interface for administrators to manage library resources, track issued books, monitor returns, and calculate overdue fines automatically.

## 2. Key Features

- Admin Login and Authentication
- Dashboard with live statistics
- Book Management (Add, Edit, Delete, Search)
- Member Management
- Issue and Return Books
- Automatic Due Date Tracking
- Automatic Overdue Fine Calculation
- Transaction History
- Reports and Analytics
- Search and Filtering
- Input Validation and Error Handling

