## 9. Business Rules

- A member can borrow a maximum of 3 active books.
- Default borrowing period is 14 days.
- Overdue fine is ₹5 per day.
- Only available books can be issued.
- A book's available quantity decreases when issued.
- A book's available quantity increases when returned.
- Duplicate ISBN entries are not allowed.
- Members cannot borrow the same title twice while it is already issued to them.

