## 11. Agile Development Methodology

The project follows Scrum-inspired Agile development practices.

Development was divided into the following stages:

- Sprint 0: Project setup and planning
- Sprint 1: Authentication and management modules
- Sprint 2: Book circulation and issuing
- Sprint 3: Returns, fines, and transaction history
- Sprint 4: Dashboard, reports, testing, and improvements

